      ],
      "text": "When Yumemizuki Mizuki triggers a Swirl or Stellar Swirl reaction while in Dreamdrifter, its duration increases by 2.5s (max twice per Dreamdrifter). While Dreamdrifter is active, she applies a debuff every 3.5s that, when a Swirl or Stellar Swirl next lands on the debuffed enemy, is consumed to add a large EM-scaled flat bonus to that reaction instance."
    },
